# AI coding agents. Shared configuration is committed: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md,
# .claude/settings.json, .claude/hooks/, .claude/skills/, .claude/agents/ and
# .mcp.json (see CONTRIBUTING.md, "AI coding agents"). Personal and
# session-local files stay out.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
CLAUDE.local.md
NEXT_STEPS.md
.superpowers/
.followups-ledger.md

# GitHub Copilot (coding agent, CLI and Chat) reads AGENTS.md, so the repo
# ships no copilot-instructions.md; a local one and session exports stay out.
.github/copilot-instructions.md
copilot-session-*.md

# Local git worktrees
.worktrees/
